      "side": 1,
      "message": "As per our discussion yesterday, I changed to code so, within a command buffer, it serializes all the pipelines first, then all the bindGroups second. This ensures that schema:::ObjectIds for the implicit bindGroupLayouts referenced by the bindGroups will already exist. \n\nThe only complication is if there\u0027s a call to setBindGroup using an implicit bindGroup from a pipeline that is never set. That case is effectively either (a) a no-op or (b) an error. The error case is caught by the command buffer execution code so the capture code just doesn\u0027t serializes those bindGroups nor their setBindGroup commands.",
